whatever home improvement task they were taking on. So I understand that you and a friend were doing this work together. Was it a good work environment? What was the boss like? It was a really fun work environment, and I did work there with my good friend, and that made the hours pass quickly along with the work. Our boss, as he probably needed to be managing young students in a lumberyard, was pretty strict and stern, but that didn't really bother us.
无论他们正在进行什么样的家居装修任务。所以我了解到你和一个朋友一起做这份工作。那是一个好的工作环境吗？老板怎么样？那是一个非常有趣的工作环境，我和我的好朋友在那里工作，这让工作时间过得很快。我们的老板，正如他管理木材厂的年轻学生所需要的那样，非常严格和严肃，但这并没有真正困扰我们。

