00:03:48.000 --> 00:04:19.000
It was a good work environment. I enjoyed it. So at one point over the summer, both you and your friend needed some time off, and that led to something very interesting. Tell me the story of what happened. Yeah, so both my friend and I got called into the office one day by the boss, and he informed us that we had both requested vacation at the same time. And he said, one of you has to work here.
那是一个很好的工作环境。我很喜欢。那么在夏天某个时候，你和你的朋友都需要请假，这导致了一些非常有趣的事情。告诉我发生了什么事。是的，有一天我和朋友都被老板叫进办公室，他通知我们，我们俩都在同一时间申请了休假。他说，你们俩中必须有一个人留下来工作。

