both with him and my friend. How did it turn up? Well, neither of us budged. And our boss sort of got frustrated. And eventually he accused or said, I think the two of you planned this together. Like you're going somewhere to goof off or something like that. And at that moment, it sort of flipped because it seemed like maybe he was accusing us of lying or there was some trust breakdown here. So there was this awkward silence. And then almost at the same time, my friend and I said, I quit. And we took off our hard hats and unclipped our measuring tape and handed it to our boss and said, that's it. We're done.
无论是对他还是对我的朋友。结果如何？好吧，我们俩都没有让步。我们的老板有点沮丧。最终他指责或说，我想你们俩是串通好的。就像你们要去什么地方偷懒之类的。那一刻，情况发生了转变，因为看起来他好像在指责我们撒谎，或者这里存在某种信任破裂。于是出现了一阵尴尬的沉默。然后几乎在同一时间，我和朋友说，我不干了。我们摘下安全帽，解下卷尺，递给老板说，就这样吧。我们不干了。

