00:05:47.000 --> 00:06:26.000
It's almost like one of those Hollywood moments, right, when the worker is really frustrated and basically flings their paths down at the boss and walks out the door. That's exactly right. I mean, the stakes weren't incredibly high because this was a high school. job, but nonetheless, it did have a little bit of a Hollywood quality to it. So many years later, Anthony, you were working for the food company General Mills. For listeners who are not familiar with the company, describe the range of things the company does and what your role was at the company? Yes, so it's a food manufacturing and marketing company.
这就像好莱坞电影里的那种时刻，对吧，当员工感到非常沮丧，基本上把东西扔给老板然后走出门口。完全正确。我的意思是，赌注并不是特别高，因为这是一份高中工作，但尽管如此，它确实有一点好莱坞的色彩。多年后，安东尼，你在食品公司通用磨坊（General Mills）工作。对于不熟悉这家公司的听众，请描述一下该公司业务的范围以及你在公司的角色？是的，这是一家食品制造和营销公司。

